{"id":"9619f9eac9e07e87","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-df-zfc-forcing8-ccc-forcing.md","title":"ZFC Forcing8 Ccc Forcing","display":"df-zfc-forcing8-ccc-forcing — ZFC Forcing8 Ccc Forcing","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-forcing8-ccc-forcing","aliases":["58-df-zfc-forcing8-ccc-forcing"],"display":"df-zfc-forcing8-ccc-forcing — ZFC Forcing8 Ccc Forcing","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-pair.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-forcing8-ccc-forcing"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-forcing8-ccc-forcing</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-forcing8-ccc-forcing — ZFC Forcing8 Ccc Forcing"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f16f4ca5b9c48bbe\" href=\"?note=f16f4ca5b9c48bbe\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-pair.md\">../batch12/58-df-pair.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak P,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\in V\">\\(\\mathfrak P,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle:V^2\\to V\">\\(\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle:V^2\\to V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f16f4ca5b9c48bbe\" href=\"?note=f16f4ca5b9c48bbe\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-pair.md\">../batch12/58-df-pair.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing8CccForcing}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing8CccForcing}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|\">\\(|A|\\)</span> 为集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的唯一基数，使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a> 的基数函数。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing8\\text{-}ccc\\text{-}forcing} \\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing8CccForcing}_S(\\mathfrak P)\\leftrightarrow\\;&amp;\n\\exists\\mathbb P\\;\\exists\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathfrak P=\\langle\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\rangle\\land\n\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\land\\mathbb P\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb P\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\bigl[\n\\forall p,q\\in A\\;(p\\neq q\\to\n\\neg\\exists r\\in\\mathbb P\\;(r\\leq_{\\mathbb P}p\\land r\\leq_{\\mathbb P}q))\n\\bigr]\\to |A|\\leq\\omega\n\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing8\\text{-}ccc\\text{-}forcing} \\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing8CccForcing}_S(\\mathfrak P)\\leftrightarrow\\;&amp;\n\\exists\\mathbb P\\;\\exists\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathfrak P=\\langle\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\rangle\\land\n\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\land\\mathbb P\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb P\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\bigl[\n\\forall p,q\\in A\\;(p\\neq q\\to\n\\neg\\exists r\\in\\mathbb P\\;(r\\leq_{\\mathbb P}p\\land r\\leq_{\\mathbb P}q))\n\\bigr]\\to |A|\\leq\\omega\n\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The unary argument is an ordered-poset code, preserving its use as a forcing-class parameter; every antichain in the coded order is countable.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-pair.md","status":"resolved","id":"f16f4ca5b9c48bbe","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-pair.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Poset}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-pair.md","status":"resolved","id":"f16f4ca5b9c48bbe","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle:V^2\\to V$ (see [[../batch12/58-df-pair.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$|A|$ 为集合 $A$ 的唯一基数，使用 [[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]] 的基数函数。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathfrak P,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Poset}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle:V^2\\to V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing8CccForcing}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"|A|","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing8\\text{-}ccc\\text{-}forcing} \\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing8CccForcing}_S(\\mathfrak P)\\leftrightarrow\\;&\n\\exists\\mathbb P\\;\\exists\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathfrak P=\\langle\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\rangle\\land\n\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\land\\mathbb P\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\\\\n&\\qquad\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb P\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\bigl[\n\\forall p,q\\in A\\;(p\\neq q\\to\n\\neg\\exists r\\in\\mathbb P\\;(r\\leq_{\\mathbb P}p\\land r\\leq_{\\mathbb P}q))\n\\bigr]\\to |A|\\leq\\omega\n\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1492,"backlinks":[{"id":"a48ce5effa2b8b13","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcForcing8CccForcing}_S\\subseteq V$ (see [[../batch05/58-df-zfc-forcing8-ccc-forcing.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2116","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-zfc-forcing8-ccc-forcing.md|58-df-zfc-forcing8-ccc-forcing]]（batch05）"}],"outgoing":["d3f859dbdd37f018","f16f4ca5b9c48bbe","2be08d4ee8aa1590"]}